	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n				TICKETING INFO\nSeason tickets are available
	. 6-show packages start at just $34 per-show. \nTickets are $46 and are av
	ailable online or by calling TUTS Guest Services at 713-558-8887. Tickets 
	will also available in person Monday through Friday from Noon to 6 p.m. at
	 the TUTS Box Office\, located in the Hobby Center lobby. \nDiscounted gro
	up tickets are available for parties of 10 or more.Theatre Under The Stars
	 has a variety of accessibility options for guests.Learn more about access
	ible performances and other services here. \nRush tickets will be availabl
	e for $35 at the box office for mezzanine and gallery seating starting 2 h
	ours prior to curtain. \nQuestions about parking\, dining or other aspects
	 of attending a TUTS show? We’ve got answers! \n			\n				\n				\n				\n			
